{"unit_id":"tag:034D:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节找出概形（schemes）的若干性质，它们在光滑（smooth）拓扑（topology）中于基底（base）上是局部（local）的。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"本节研究的对象。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"光滑拓扑。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"用于判定局部性的拓扑。"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底","context":"概形性质的基底局部性。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"性质相对于光滑覆盖的局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:034E:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>约化（reduced）”是光滑（smooth）拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化","context":"概形的约化性质。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"光滑拓扑。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"用于下降约化性的拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"概形性质的覆盖局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:034E:proof","translation":"我们将利用引理<REF_0001>。首先注意，“约化（reduced）”是Zariski拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。这由定义即知，见《概形（Schemes）》定义<REF_0002>。接着证明，若<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affines）之间的光滑（smooth）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0002>约化（reduced），则<MATH_0003>约化（reduced）。这就是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0003>。最后证明，若<MATH_0004>是仿射概形（affines）之间的满射（surjective）光滑（smooth）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0005>约化（reduced），则<MATH_0006>约化（reduced）。这就是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0004>。因此引理<REF_0005>的(1)、(2)、(3)成立，证明完成。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化","context":"需要检验局部性的概形性质。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"Zariski拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"性质的Zariski局部性。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"上升和下降条件中的仿射概形。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"用于检测性质的态射条件。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"仿射概形之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"用于下降的覆盖态射。"}],"notes":[]}
