{"unit_id":"tag:036C:statement","translation":"性质<MATH_0001>“<MATH_0002>局部诺特（locally Noetherian）且满足<MATH_0003>”是光滑（smooth）拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"与受保护的余维正则条件同时要求的概形性质。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"光滑拓扑。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"用于下降该性质的拓扑。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"概形性质的覆盖局部性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:036C:proof","translation":"我们将检验引理<REF_0001>的(1)、(2)、(3)。由于光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）平坦（flat）且有限表现（finite presentation）（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>），对“局部诺特（locally Noetherian）”，我们已在引理<REF_0004>的证明中检验过这一点。在证明中将直接使用它，不再另行说明。首先注意，<MATH_0001>是Zariski拓扑（topology）中的局部（local）性质。这由定义即知，见《性质（Properties）》定义<REF_0005>。接着证明，若<MATH_0002>是仿射概形（affines）之间的光滑（smooth）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0003>具有<MATH_0004>，则<MATH_0005>具有<MATH_0006>。这就是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0006>（利用《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0007>、《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0008>和<REF_0009>）。最后证明，若<MATH_0007>是仿射概形（affines）之间的满射（surjective）光滑（smooth）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0008>具有<MATH_0009>，则<MATH_0010>具有<MATH_0011>。这就是《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0010>。因此引理<REF_0011>的(1)、(2)、(3)成立，证明完成。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"光滑态射的上升和下降作用。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"仿射概形之间的态射。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"光滑态射具有的平坦性。"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表现","con