{"unit_id":"tag:036D:proof","translation":"这由上面的引理<REF_0001>即知，因为局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）是正则（regular）的，当且仅当它局部诺特（locally Noetherian）且满足<MATH_0001>，对所有<MATH_0002>均如此。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部诺特","context":"正则性刻画中的有限性条件。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"需要检验正则性的对象。"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则","context":"由全部余维正则条件刻画的性质。"}],"notes":[]}
